l shortage areas.</p>","updateDate":"2025-03-26T19:42:16Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Prevent Interruptions in Physical Therapy Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-17T23:59:57Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-17T23:59:57Z"}
